WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:08.690
Labor: A robot specifically designed
for construction work.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.990
Labors allow dramatic advances
in construction...

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.700
but also in crime.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.950
To combat these
new Labor crimes...

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.620
the police created a special unit:
The Patrol Labor.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:22.540
And thus, the birth of Patlabor.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.190
yume wo sutenaide
You must not let go of your dreams

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.990
me wo sorasanaide
And never turn your gaze away

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:58.990
futari no ai mo kumoru yo
Yet even still love may cloud up and fade away

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.370
utsumuita kata wo
And even though you comforted your love

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.370
dakishimeta keredo
When he was feeling down

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:11.210
samishisa mune ni tsumotta
Sadness was still weighing down his heavy heart

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.430
yume wa kimi no buki no hazu da yo
Hang on tight to your dreams - they're weapons in your arsenal

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:25.020
nee da kara kanashimi mo kinukete itte
You'll find that you can get through anything at all

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:31.360
so never cry itsu mo kimi wo mitsumete 'ru yo
So never cry - you know I will always be watching over you

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:37.150
fair na ikikata no kimi ga suki
What I love about you is your strong sense of fairness

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:43.700
so never cry itsu mo kimi no soba ni iru yo
So never cry - you know I will always be right there by your side

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.380
da kara mata asu e kakedashite
And so now you can face your future fearlessly

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:01.220
The Green Phantom

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.810
Who's there?

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:52.060
A demon! It's a demon!

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.240
Construction of
Capital Loop Route 20...

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.080
is being obstructed
by somebody.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:12.830
Shinohara, Izumi, and Yamazaki,
go and investigate the scene.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.750
Look into things and figure out
what's going on.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.630
Um, why are you sending
just the three of us?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.890
Well, no particular reason.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:28.270
This is pretty close by,
so we can't ignore it.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:32.100
At the same time, we can't
leave the station unmanned.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.440
Captain, can't the
local police handle this?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.360
Why do they need us?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.610
Don't ask questions, Shinohara.
Just do it.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.160
The local officers will
fill you in on the details.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:49.250
Izumi, Yamazaki, and Shinohara,
heading out!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.040
Yeah, good luck.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.170
I hope Asuma does okay.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.720
He's pretending
that he's not upset.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.180
What a man.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.300
You rookies don't know anything.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:08.680
Hey, face facts.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.480
Asuma gets some tough missions.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:16.520
He defends Division 2's honor,
while defusing the bomb.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:17.400
The bomb?

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.190
Oh, Ota!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.790
Hiromi, you're not your usual self.
What's wrong?

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.290
I'm just a little worried.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.290
Why?

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:41.300
We're going to a place
they call Demon Haunt Village.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:42.550
So?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:46.510
"Demons recite
a melancholy poem...

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.310
"for the people who
live in the village of the tree."

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:53.930
That's a poem about the
legend of Demon Haunt Village.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:55.060
Legend?

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:56.940
Yes.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:05.200
It happened a long time ago,
when the village was first settled...

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:11.790
Fierce demons came
down from the mountains...

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.330
and caused quite a lot of havoc.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:19.250
But one day, when the demons
came down to the village...

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.170
they saw a girl...

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.970
desperately tending to the animals
that they themselves had hurt.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.680
She was the chief's daughter.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:34.560
At that moment, the demons
fell in love with the kind girl.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.600
But shortly, an illness
spread through the village.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:42.110
The girl, who had a weak constitution,
became sick and died.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.900
The demons hadn't understood
what death was.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.160
But now
they ceased their violence.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.660
They came down from their
mountains to visit her grave.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.040
They recited poems,
in memory of the kind girl.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.080
As if in response to the poems,

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:04.090
a fine zelkova tree sprouted
from the girl's grave.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:08.260
To this day, the villagers have
their own New Year's Eve custom.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:12.390
They gather inside and solemnly
listen to the winter wind in the trees,

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.060
believing that they are
the poems of the demons.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.640
What a sad story.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.440
I'm surprised to hear
you talk so much, Hiromi.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.730
I like folk tales and legends.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:30.700
This case may have something
to do with your story.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:31.910
Think about it.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:37.040
The captain said
to keep our eyes and ears open.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.880
I bet he suspects there may be
something else going on here.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.170
What do you mean?

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.000
Maybe it's a curse!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.050
Hey, stop that!

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.630
It's possible!

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.430
Hiromi, the wheel! The wheel!

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.660
What happened?

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.620
How awful!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:18.080
I warned them!
I told them this would happen!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:22.040
I told them to look into this
before deciding on the route!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:27.090
But, no! They just looked at the maps
and sent us off to begin construction!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.970
And even then they didn't put
enough time in the schedule!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:31.800
I can't take it!

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.680
I'm at my wit's end now!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:38.770
I have a wife and family
waiting for me at home!

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.640
But we have a deadline,

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:46.570
and there isn't a single
machine left that we can use!

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:52.150
It might be someone
opposed to the construction.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.620
You'd need a Labor
to cause this sort of damage.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.080
- But it's very strange...
- What?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.620
When these strange events
first occurred...

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.830
my men got totally upset.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:11.260
An old woman, taking a break
from working in the fields,

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.050
was watching us.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:17.550
One of my men asked her
if she'd seen anything suspicious.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.640
And she said...

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.850
"I ain't seen nothing."

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.350
Those were her exact words!

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:29.020
No. But that's not all!
You see...

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.950
A curse?! You mean...?!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.820
You mean the demons
of the zelkova tree?

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:41.660
Oh, you've heard about that?
There. It's over there.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.420
Incredible!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:55.470
It's a beautiful zelkova tree.
Probably a thousand years old.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:09:00.640
Rather than being a sacred tree,
legend says demons are trapped inside.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:06.600
That's why the villagers call this
the "Demon Haunt" tree.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:12.030
The demons killed the village chief
and a Shinto priest many years ago.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.740
They even covered that
in a magazine.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:19.530
One windy night recently,
our night watchman saw a demon!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:24.580
He quit right after that
and went home.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:31.000
This tree is a landmark,
but it's in the middle of my road!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:33.880
What am I supposed to do?

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:38.550
Did this all start
when you tried to remove the tree?

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:39.890
Yes.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:44.220
- What's wrong, Hiromi?
- Nothing.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.940
What can I do?

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:52.150
My workers are all
afraid to touch that tree.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:55.940
Our new equipment
should be arriving any time...

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:59.740
and so I need to
start construction tomorrow!

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.370
But at this rate,
we'll be headed for winter...

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.410
and I won't be able to
go home for New Year's.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:12.630
All right.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.720
Why don't you just
build the road around the tree?

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.890
If we could do that,
we would've done it by now!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.010
Of course.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:25.470
So, what are you going to do
with the sacred tree?

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:28.850
It's too big to transplant.

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.480
And I don't even think
a Labor could do it.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:35.980
Please, help me!
You're the only ones I can turn to!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.740
We'll start looking into this,
so don't touch the crime scene.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:45.790
Nobody's working anyway,
whether or not there are demons.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.080
Hiromi?

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:51.120
Miss Izumi, aren't you scared?

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.290
Of course not, Hiromi.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.210
Normally, we'd approach this
as a Labor crime...

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:59.550
The curse.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:03.430
The curse of the haunting demons.

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:08.560
The curse, the curse...

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:17.440
Excuse me.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.820
Deny the world!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.590
How rude.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:02.820
Fire-fighting Labor

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.830
Girl Labor

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.500
All right, all right!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.040
Hiromi, a little more!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:14.830
Okay.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.090
Labor footprints!

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:22.010
And it's not a
construction model!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:23.680
You're right.

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:27.600
The marks on the body were
made by a Labor's hands.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:30.220
Must be.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.980
So this was all done deliberately,
using a Labor.

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:37.610
Then they used
more than one Labor.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.480
So, who could have done it?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.450
They used force
to halt construction.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.160
The damage has been
restricted to this village.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:52.200
So, it must be someone
trying to preserve the sacred tree.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:57.540
So, someone's trying to make it
look like the curse. Or else...

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:58.540
Or else?

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.760
Maybe it's the result
of a real curse.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.670
Do you really think so?

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:14.270
Wow! An Italian-made
Ghamborginni!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:17.400
How tacky.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.020
These Italian Labors
sure are fantastic!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.440
Can't beat their
speed and power!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.450
You seem to be doing a fine job.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.030
I hope your
investigation is going well.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:34.040
I'm the one who sold this land
to the government.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.870
That's why I'm interested
in the construction.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:40.130
You used to own the sacred tree?

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.840
No, unfortunately
that area wasn't mine.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:46.840
Listen, you should just
stay away from that tree!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.140
For centuries,

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:54.220
the souls of the mountain demons
have inhabited that tree.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.350
That's all I can tell you.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.690
So, I suggest you talk it over
with the government.

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:03.150
If you build the road
a little further to the south,

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.730
you could avoid the tree.

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:08.700
I'd be willing to sell the land, cheap.
How's that?

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:11.740
Sorry, we're in no position
to negotiate.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.410
We're just here to investigate.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:17.620
Too bad. The demons are
probably already angry.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:21.290
Might be too late anyway.
Sorry to bother you!

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:26.920
What was that all about?

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:28.470
What was that all about?

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:35.100
I can no longer remain silent!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.640
Tea is ready.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:39.730
Thank you.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.810
- Where's Izumi?
- Inspecting Alphonse.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.320
Asuma...

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.700
Is this really
the cause of some curse?

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.200
The only thing
we know for sure is that,

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.200
whether it is a curse
or just a ruse...

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:56.080
we're here to figure out
what's going on and solve the problem.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.420
A power failure?

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:11.300
What?!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.310
Let's see. Who's there?!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:30.610
- Halt!
- Noa, what's wrong?!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.160
Somebody tried to attack,
and ran off that way!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:36.950
Hiromi!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.790
Th-There...

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.170
I lost him.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:51.300
Did you get a look at it?

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.050
From the infrared sensor,

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.680
its heat signature was
definitely that of a Labor.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.850
Well, if that's how they want it,
we can play rough.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.310
What's about to happen?

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.650
The Tokyo Labor team
is up to something.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.020
I understand.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:11.320
We'll move the Labor.
So, just stand by on site.

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.160
Right. Let's go.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.000
Asuma, do you think
we can lure it out?

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:23.920
I don't know.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:29.750
Look at that!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.220
Labor. Step aside.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.430
Are you still here?!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:38.430
Disturbing our demons any further
will raise the dead!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:42.810
We won't let you through.
Be nice and leave our village!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.900
Noa, get ready.
You too, Hiromi.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.870
It's time for you to be nice.

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:58.990
It's huge!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:01.240
Gramps! It's two against one!
Let's do it!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.550
Don't be stupid!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:14.300
It's too late to back out!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.010
Why, you!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.140
Rice fields are narrow...

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.810
so this Labor's designed
to make tight turns.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:27.900
Why, you!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.520
Noa, behind you!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.820
I don't want any trouble!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.360
Please, just go
and leave us alone!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:41.490
Wow, those Italian jobs really
have it! Great handling ability!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.500
This isn't the time to be impressed!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:50.960
Oh, no!
I'm getting stuck in the mud!

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.920
Will you go home now?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.590
You aren't going to get
another shot at my legs!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.770
Well, if that's how you want it,
then fine!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:13.150
Now I'm mad!
Don't mess with me!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.870
Please! Please, stop it!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:25.950
We can't let them
cut down our tree!

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.160
Stop fighting!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:30.420
You're the ones that'll get in
trouble with the demons, Grandpa.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:31.630
But...

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:35.210
You'll have to fight me first
to get to them.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:39.930
The Special Vehicles, Second Section,
Division 2 won't let you do that!

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.930
Special Vehicles, Second Section,
Division 2?

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.600
What's wrong with that?

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:49.060
I knew the police had
several Labor teams,

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.150
but I never thought
this would be them.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:55.070
Division 2's famous for
causing all kinds of havoc in cities...

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.320
with reckless shooting!

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.240
That's right.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:01.030
When Division 2 passes through,
the land beneath is laid waste.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.120
Well...

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.990
No way would I ever take them on!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.500
Oh, well.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:17.050
When we were at war with the
Americans during World War II...

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:21.680
an order was issued to turn over
all of the village's silver and gold.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:26.930
However, before we were able to
hand over the treasure we collected...

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.730
the war had come to an end.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:34.610
So, the village chief, the priest,
and I came up with a plan.

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.270
In the confusion of it all,

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.190
we buried it in the roots
of the zelkova tree.

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:40.950
But why?

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:44.200
Seemed as good as anywhere.

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.660
What matters is
that we didn't return it.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:52.250
But then, both the chief
and priest got sick and died.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:57.090
For the honor of our chief and priest,
I had to keep the secret.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:00.050
You never told me any of this!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:03.090
Once I heard
of the construction,

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:07.220
I planned to move the treasure.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.680
But the night watchman saw me.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:13.560
He thought
my Labor was a demon...

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:16.400
and everyone blamed the curse.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:20.610
So you just used me as your
mercenary! That stinks!

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:23.740
Don't be so self-righteous.
You accepted his money.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.910
This is incredible!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.540
I knew all about this, Grandpa.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.090
- What?
- Grandma told me.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:41.710
That tree has protected
our village for ages.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.720
What you did back then
was wrong...

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:48.890
but it was best that our village
and the zelkova were protected.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:51.430
That's why
I never said anything.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:57.020
Isn't there some way
we can save our tree?

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:00.730
Asuma?

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:05.950
What's going on?

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.660
I don't know! I can't see!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:10.160
They must have
made the demons angry!

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:12.000
We must pray!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.370
A mountain?

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:18.420
There's one right there,
behind my temple.

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:20.300
Noa, do you read me?

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.420
Yeah, did you find something?

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:25.880
I'll tell you later.
Can you carry that tree?

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:29.100
What? This? I think so.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:32.600
We're going to transplant it
to the hill behind the shrine.

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:36.310
- Say what?
- Miss Izumi, I'll help you.

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.480
Um, I want to help, too.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.650
I don't really know
what's going on...

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:43.110
but I don't have a problem
with transplanting the zelkova tree.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:57.290
Everyone. Special Vehicles,
Second Section will help us.

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:01.340
We're going to transplant
the sacred tree to the mountain.

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:04.510
Wow, it's Division 2!

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:06.840
It'll do well up on the mountain.

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:10.220
That tree is the symbol
of our village.

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:12.510
It's better this way.

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:17.060
The demons and their tree are
returning to the mountain.

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:19.900
There's still one thing
I don't understand.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:23.440
I know your Labor
and the old man's...

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:26.070
but where did the girl get one?

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:29.070
Oh, Hiromi's always
had a weak constitution.

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:30.240
Hiromi?

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:45.920
dakishimete MIDNIGHT BLUE
Just hold me tightly, Midnight Blue

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:49.630
kon'ya reiji no basu ni nottara
If I can make it to the bus stop by midnight

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.890
ichido-kiri nara dekiru hazu da kara
I know I can do it, if only just once

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:05.400
yume ni hikizurare
Pulled into my dream I find that I wake up

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:08.320
ore wa ase mamire no Lonely
Drenched in sweat and feeling lonely

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:12.910
hanashi-aite no TV suitchi hipparu
I turn off the TV I've been listening to

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:17.580
ashita ichinichi wa
Tomorrow I will spend the whole day

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:20.420
akogareta machi no gomi no naka
In the city of my dreams, amidst the old dust

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:24.590
hayaku mein sutoriito ni sawaritai no sa
I want to feel the main street beneath my feet soon

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:31.090
manazashi dake wa itsu demo
I plan to always look on the brighter side

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:36.350
ue wo muite 'ru tsumori
Keep my chin up, look to the future

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:38.890
tatta hitotsu no michi da kara
After all, there's only one path I can travel

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:42.100
dakishimete MIDNIGHT BLUE
Just hold me tightly, Midnight Blue

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:46.190
kon'ya reiji no basu ni nottara
If I can make it to the bus stop by midnight

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:52.360
ichido-kiri nara dekiru hazu da kara
I know I can do it, if only just once

00:23:54.530 --> 00:23:58.410
kon'ya reiji no basu ni nottara
If I can make it to the bus stop by midnight

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:05.040
ichido-kiri nara dekiru hazu da kara
I know I can do it, if only just once

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:10.300
This story is fiction...

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:10.300
but in 10 years, who knows?

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:16.970
The Doshka, a military Labor
that came from a frigid country.

00:24:17.430 --> 00:24:19.430
Apparently,
terrorists are after it,

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:22.190
and so Division 2 is sent out
to deal with it.

00:24:22.270 --> 00:24:24.230
I hear it's a request
from Public Safety,

00:24:24.310 --> 00:24:26.400
but why is it only Noa and I
that are going off to Sakata?

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:28.520
It's just a treat from the Captain,
that's all.

00:24:28.690 --> 00:24:30.320
He said we should enjoy ourselves.

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:32.900
That's too easy.
There must be another reason.

00:24:32.990 --> 00:24:36.990
Next time. Red Labor Landing.
Target, locked on!

00:24:35.820 --> 00:24:41.580
Next episode

00:24:35.820 --> 00:24:41.580
Red Labor Landing
